== On Visualization ==

Visual diagrams are not decorations but tools for thinking. They should reveal structure, not obscure it. The specifications here are offered as guidance—approaches that have proven useful, not constraints that must be followed.

The guiding principle: ''Does this visualization enhance understanding?''

