== Quality Criteria ===

| Criterion | Check |
|-----------|-------|
| Clarity | Can the diagram be understood in <30 seconds? |
| Accuracy | Do relationships match the text? |
| Completeness | Are all key elements included? |
| Simplicity | Can any elements be removed without loss? |
| Accessibility | Can it be understood without color? |
| Consistency | Does it follow notation standards? |

Diagrams that fail these criteria should be revised or removed.